--- BDD-38 判据逐项 ---
① 存在可机器解析的跳过清单                     = True
② 清单非空                                     = True
   条目数 == N − 实际内联 sibling 数            = 1 == 41-40 -> True
③ 每项可对应到具体文件名（count_limit 类）      = True
   count_limit 首项 = {"file_id": 82, "reason": "count_limit", "filename": "s40.css", "path": null, "size": 6}
   reason 值 ⊆ 六元闭集                        = True（实际 ['count_limit']）
   file_id 无重复                              = True

--- 语义区分（41 真实 id + 1 个不存在的 id）---
  skipped = [{"file_id": 82, "reason": "count_limit", "filename": "s40.css", "path": null, "size": 6}, {"file_id": 999999, "reason": "not_found", "filename": null, "path": null, "size": null}]
